sub:assertion {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/high-composite-with-failing-gates> a delphi:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "On the winged-zebrafish run the scorer's composite is 0.878 and flagged plausible, yet two of the five named gates fail, two cannot be assessed, and the validator withholds the word validated." ;
    dct:description "STATUS: an observation about one run (generated=winged-zebrafish, base=zebrafish-adult), read from the fixture swarm/benchmark/fixtures/gt-l4-t1.json and the CLI at sim-engine/validate-cli.mjs:17. The gate results are phenotype_similarity pass, functional_resolution fail, physics_check fail, genotype_similarity cannot-assess, lean_check cannot-assess. The scorer composite (version 1.0.0) is carried for reference only and no gate feeds it, so a high composite sits beside failing gates without contradicting the report. The validator's verdict is that validated is withheld. DOES NOT ESTABLISH: that the winged zebrafish glides or survives as desired, that the design is biologically sound, that the composite is a poor scorer in general, or anything about runs other than this one. It also does not show the two unassessed gates would pass or fail, and no sequence was compared at any locus." ;
    delphi:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/high-composite-with-failing-gates> .

  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/high-composite-with-failing-gates> a delphi:EvidenceItem ;
    rdfs:label "Fixture gt-l4-t1 results for the winged-zebrafish validation run" ;
    dct:description "Values read from swarm/benchmark/fixtures/gt-l4-t1.json (results, composite_score_from_the_scorer, verdict.word_validated_withheld, verdict.withheld_because, verdict.scales_not_assessed) and from the exit-code rule at sim-engine/validate-cli.mjs:17. The desired phenotype was a zebrafish that glides at least 5 m from a 1 m launch and survives 10-30 C as an adult." ;
    schema:additionalProperty
      <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/high-composite-with-failing-gates/composite> ,
      <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/high-composite-with-failing-gates/scorer-version> ,
